{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bTWjeVhhTn1795319219.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>選委會界別分組選舉正在進行，選管會主席陸啟康到灣仔會展巡視選舉中央指揮中心後見記者。</p><p></p><p>陸啟康指，選委會選舉中央指揮中心及數據資訊中心運作暢順，截至上午11時，逾3,900人投票，投票率逾百分之68，有信心點票工作能在合理時間內完成。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:23:37.704663+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T03:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:37:34.348396+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T05:17:03.442733+00:00","content_hash":"42270fbd321d8042d38af7ffa5dbb93e89c6580bcf4c8614fee59572caed00be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T05:23:37.704663+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}